        <strong>Prioritize mobile stability to compete with Gemini and Claude.</strong> Google Gemini (4.75%) and Claude (4.17%) lead in bug/performance complaints. A stable, fast mobile experience is a table-stakes differentiator. Invest in crash-rate reduction, cold-start latency, and device-fragmentation testing — then message reliability explicitly in app store copy and release notes.
